WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:14.467
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

00:00:16.542 --> 00:00:17.552
[fzzt]

00:00:17.552 --> 00:00:18.853
--AAAAGH!

00:00:18.853 --> 00:00:21.833
Oh! That was horrible!

00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:23.614
Wait... no!

00:00:23.614 --> 00:00:24.923
What is this?!

00:00:24.923 --> 00:00:27.085
THIS ISN'T MASSACHUSETTS!

00:00:27.085 --> 00:00:28.358
Oh no...

00:00:28.358 --> 00:00:30.245
Oh, God! They fucked me!

00:00:30.245 --> 00:00:33.778
I TOLD THEM EXACTLY WHAT TO DO
AND THEY FUCKED ME!

00:00:33.778 --> 00:00:36.311
[screaming]

00:00:36.311 --> 00:00:38.815
THIS IS WORSE THAN EVERYTHING!

00:00:38.815 --> 00:00:41.484
Oh, God! I feel strange...!

00:00:41.484 --> 00:00:42.427
Dizzy...!

00:00:42.427 --> 00:00:44.113
Is this gravity...?!

00:00:44.113 --> 00:00:45.783
Oh! Okay...!

00:00:45.783 --> 00:00:48.034
[whimpering]

00:00:48.034 --> 00:00:58.672
[hyperventilating]

00:00:58.672 --> 00:01:01.548
Okay... well, I gotta do something...

00:01:01.548 --> 00:01:04.472
This day's going to shit.

00:01:04.472 --> 00:01:07.058
All right. There's something over there.

00:01:07.058 --> 00:01:08.835
I'm going for it.

00:01:08.835 --> 00:01:10.331
NnyaaaaaaaAAAAAAA--

00:01:10.331 --> 00:01:10.995
Oof!

00:01:10.995 --> 00:01:12.434
Are you kidding me?

00:01:13.204 --> 00:01:14.000
Fuck.

00:01:15.078 --> 00:01:16.449
Oh, he's hiding.

00:01:16.449 --> 00:01:18.734
Gee, where could he have gone?

00:01:19.777 --> 00:01:21.360
Oh, I think I see him.

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:22.701
I think I see him.

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.137
Yeah, that's right.
Shoot away the madness.

00:01:27.137 --> 00:01:30.566
Oh, lovely. Here's a
wonderful fucking omen.

00:01:30.566 --> 00:01:33.701
I would get a picture
of this tattooed on me.

00:01:33.701 --> 00:01:36.635
This so concisely sums up everything.

00:01:36.635 --> 00:01:37.876
Just everything.

00:01:37.876 --> 00:01:41.181
And he had a helmet on so what
does that say about me?

00:01:41.181 --> 00:01:44.333
Well, I'm not taking it.
It has germs now.

00:01:44.333 --> 00:01:47.574
Oh, God! What's happening?!

00:01:47.574 --> 00:01:49.141
Gotta keep moving.

00:01:49.141 --> 00:01:49.667
Ha!

00:01:50.768 --> 00:01:52.256
[vortigaunt charging up]
WAAAAAAAH!

00:01:52.256 --> 00:01:52.801
NO!

00:01:53.517 --> 00:01:54.289
[houndeye charging up]
STOP!

00:01:54.289 --> 00:01:55.285
[houndeye charging up]
WHERE ARE YOU?!

00:01:55.285 --> 00:01:56.801
[houndeye attack]
BLAH!

00:01:58.289 --> 00:02:01.644
YOU HAVE ALL OF
INFINITE SPACE TO TELEPORT TO!

00:02:01.644 --> 00:02:06.299
I'VE ALREADY CLAIMED THIS...
horrible... chunk...

00:02:06.299 --> 00:02:10.081
Okay, I guess I'll make my way
to the big thing, then...

00:02:10.081 --> 00:02:13.167
...blow my brains out, I don't know...

00:02:14.509 --> 00:02:15.058
Ha!

00:02:15.058 --> 00:02:16.482
...don't miss, don't miss!

00:02:16.482 --> 00:02:18.749
Oh, good, it didn't flip.

00:02:18.749 --> 00:02:23.083
I'm not sure how these are floating;
I guess they're filled with a lighter gas?

00:02:23.083 --> 00:02:27.088
I mean, if it was magnetism, wouldn't
that affect some of my suit or weapons?

00:02:27.088 --> 00:02:29.323
Actually, I don't know
what metals are on me.

00:02:29.323 --> 00:02:29.884
Dah!

00:02:29.884 --> 00:02:30.875
Eee!

00:02:30.875 --> 00:02:31.567
NYAAH!

00:02:32.306 --> 00:02:34.175
Okay, don't freak out...

00:02:34.175 --> 00:02:35.374
Don't freak out...!

00:02:35.374 --> 00:02:37.408
I SAID DON'T FREAK OUT, DAMMIT!

00:02:37.408 --> 00:02:38.777
OKAY!

00:02:38.777 --> 00:02:39.567
NAH!

00:02:40.610 --> 00:02:41.428
NUH!

00:02:41.428 --> 00:02:44.023
I'M TOTALLY NOT FREAKING OUT RIGHT NOW!

00:02:44.023 --> 00:02:46.484
BECAUSE... THIS IS ME NOT FREAKING OUT!

00:02:46.484 --> 00:02:49.158
WHAT DO I HAVE TO
FREAK OUT OVER, ANYWAY?!

00:02:49.158 --> 00:02:50.975
NOTHING! BECAUSE I'M NOT!

00:02:50.975 --> 00:02:54.612
I'M JUST NAVIGATING FLOATING
OBSTACLE COURSE THAT LOOKS LIKE A...

00:02:54.612 --> 00:02:58.251
GIANT... PLATE-BALANCING TRICK
DESIGNED BY H. R. GIGER!

00:02:58.251 --> 00:03:00.026
FUCK YOU, REALITY!

00:03:00.026 --> 00:03:02.122
YOU'RE FULL OF SHIT!

00:03:02.122 --> 00:03:07.089
AND... BONE PILLAR THINGS AND...
BREATHABLE ATMOSPHERE...!

00:03:07.089 --> 00:03:08.033
NYAH!

00:03:08.589 --> 00:03:09.897
...wwwwAAAAAAH!

00:03:09.897 --> 00:03:11.837
REALITY'S BROKE!

00:03:11.837 --> 00:03:13.373
Why is there gravity?!

00:03:13.373 --> 00:03:16.636
I look below this thing and
there's just the void!

00:03:16.636 --> 00:03:17.779
Wah!

00:03:17.779 --> 00:03:19.264
Waa-aaa-AAAH!

00:03:19.264 --> 00:03:22.100
Okay, I'm clear for
landing on the hell blob.

00:03:23.673 --> 00:03:28.140
So, am I supposed to believe this thing is
dense enough to cause gravitational pull?

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:30.622
I don't fucking think so!

00:03:30.622 --> 00:03:35.398
Not only is that stupid but that would've
yanked me sideways with that top platform.

00:03:35.398 --> 00:03:37.868
A ledge. Why not?

00:03:37.868 --> 00:03:38.983
Whoa-ho-ho!

00:03:38.983 --> 00:03:40.028
[houndeye charging up, Xen crystal bolt]
WAH!

00:03:40.028 --> 00:03:41.299
[houndeye charging up]
WHAT'S HAPPENING?!

00:03:41.299 --> 00:03:42.434
[houndeye attack, Xen crystal bolt]
WAH!

00:03:43.451 --> 00:03:45.300
Shoot the madness... shoot the madness...

00:03:46.182 --> 00:03:46.971
No!

00:03:46.971 --> 00:03:48.069
[Xen crystal bolt]
WAAH!

00:03:48.069 --> 00:03:49.458
[Xen crystal bolts]
LET ME IN!

00:03:49.458 --> 00:03:50.398
[Xen crystal bolts]
God, Je..!

00:03:50.398 --> 00:03:53.007
[Xen crystal bolts]
[straining]

00:03:53.007 --> 00:03:57.394
Ah, a first aid kit. I guess
somebody else made it this far.

00:03:57.394 --> 00:04:00.189
I wonder how many explorers they
just dumped out here.

00:04:00.189 --> 00:04:01.541
Probably a lot.

00:04:01.541 --> 00:04:04.625
Maybe that's why I couldn't
get a helmet: they ran out.

00:04:04.625 --> 00:04:05.641
What the hell is this thing?

00:04:05.641 --> 00:04:07.500
[Xen crystal bolts]
Ah! Fuck!

00:04:08.735 --> 00:04:11.332
PURPLE... PROACTIVE... BUG ZAPPERS!

00:04:11.332 --> 00:04:12.777
[Xen crystal bolt]
AH!

00:04:12.777 --> 00:04:13.819
FUCK OFF!

00:04:13.819 --> 00:04:14.831
[houndeye charging up]
NO!

00:04:14.831 --> 00:04:16.026
SHUT UP!

00:04:16.026 --> 00:04:18.511
[houndeye charging up]
STOP! NO!

00:04:18.511 --> 00:04:20.300
FOR CRYING OUT L-- THERE!

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:24.606
Yeah, go do your little dance...
you freak.

00:04:24.606 --> 00:04:26.555
Yeah, you can't even do THAT right.

00:04:26.555 --> 00:04:27.842
[Xen crystal bolt]
AH!

00:04:27.842 --> 00:04:31.858
Oh!  I-- you're not worth it.
Not yet.

00:04:31.858 --> 00:04:33.334
What IS this thing?

00:04:34.563 --> 00:04:36.674
Wah! What happened?

00:04:36.674 --> 00:04:38.834
Did it steal a piece of my soul?

00:04:38.834 --> 00:04:40.290
Give it back!

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:42.881
No... it's not really worth it.

00:04:42.881 --> 00:04:45.726
Well, I guess I have a water
source... maybe.

00:04:45.726 --> 00:04:46.770
Stop that!

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:49.335
Well, I guess I'll check out the interior.

00:04:49.335 --> 00:04:53.641
Maybe I can find a weak point and blow
this up. That would make me feel better.

00:04:53.641 --> 00:04:55.765
Fucking nightmare.

00:04:55.765 --> 00:04:57.890
Oh, there IS something in here.

00:04:57.890 --> 00:05:01.946
Well... yeah, it's about
what I was expecting.

00:05:01.946 --> 00:05:03.101
A lot of water.

00:05:03.101 --> 00:05:06.107
If anything here is edible,
I can go for weeks.

00:05:06.107 --> 00:05:10.400
Well, guess this is my new home!
I'll get settled in.

00:05:11.085 --> 00:05:15.145
Is this a mushroom? I'm no
stranger to mushrooms.

00:05:15.145 --> 00:05:18.565
Oh, it lights up.
Dream décor for a stoner.

00:05:18.565 --> 00:05:20.727
It does make the place cozier.

00:05:20.727 --> 00:05:21.934
What the hell is this?

00:05:24.146 --> 00:05:26.155
Eh, I'll try and eat it later.

00:05:26.155 --> 00:05:29.760
Really, I need to eat those
things I killed on the ledge first

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:32.156
because they're going
to rot if I wait too long.

00:05:32.156 --> 00:05:35.256
I'm REALLY hoping I can find a
way to cook them

00:05:35.256 --> 00:05:38.275
because dinner is going to be
harsh enough as it is.

00:05:38.275 --> 00:05:41.505
Yeah, turn on all the mushrooms,
I don't care about the power bill.

00:05:41.505 --> 00:05:45.616
Okay, those blinking lights are
annoying; I'll take care of that later.

00:05:45.616 --> 00:05:51.138
This, actually, isn't THE worst apartment
I've ever had. It's close, though.

00:05:51.138 --> 00:05:52.929
What's this? A bird cage?

00:05:52.929 --> 00:05:58.010
Well, I'm pretty sure I can't
eat rhombuses, so you're free to go.

00:05:58.010 --> 00:05:59.163
Enjoy.

00:05:59.163 --> 00:06:01.516
Well, they'd better figure out
how to fly out of here

00:06:01.516 --> 00:06:04.020
or else I'm gonna swat 'em later.

00:06:04.020 --> 00:06:08.903
No, I don't want to waste the ammo.
I haven't done a full perimeter check yet.

00:06:08.903 --> 00:06:10.990
So, where am I going to sleep?

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:12.157
Oh no!

00:06:12.157 --> 00:06:14.702
Well, I can't call this an earthquake.

00:06:14.702 --> 00:06:16.439
Oh God! Ah!

00:06:16.439 --> 00:06:20.035
OKAY, THIS APARTMENT'S DEFINITELY
THE SECOND WORST I'VE HAD!

00:06:20.035 --> 00:06:22.584
IT'S STILL NOT INFECTED WITH BEDBUGS!

00:06:22.584 --> 00:06:25.198
WHAT IS THIS?! IS THIS A TELEPORTER?!

00:06:25.198 --> 00:06:27.896
IT COULD SEND ME INTO SPACE!
I COULD DECOMPRESS!

00:06:27.896 --> 00:06:30.240
OH GOD! THE ROOM'S CLOSING IN ON ME!

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:32.294
THESE ARE TEETH! IT'S ALIVE!

00:06:32.294 --> 00:06:34.471
THE ROOM'S GOING TO EAT ME!

00:06:34.471 --> 00:06:35.292
SHIT!

00:06:35.292 --> 00:06:37.608
OKAY, NOT A LOT OF FUCKING OPTIONS!

00:06:37.608 --> 00:06:39.006
[fzzt]
AAAAH!

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:41.881
[exhales]

00:06:43.427 --> 00:06:44.545
Great.

00:06:46.475 --> 00:06:48.272
[distant thumping]

00:06:48.272 --> 00:06:49.601
Hey, what's that noise?
[distant thumping]

00:06:49.601 --> 00:06:51.003
[distant thumping]

00:06:51.003 --> 00:06:52.828
[distant growling]

00:06:52.828 --> 00:06:56.727
[distant thumping]

